I am searching for drivers for a Korg OASYS based on the Motorola 
DSP56301.  This is an older card, and the only driver I could find for it 
via google is a 2.2 kernel based one written by Klaus Knopper.   Based on 
the ALSA cards database it looks like ther are not any official releases 
of this driver.  Was wondering if anyone is working on a driver for this 
card or other cards based on the DSP56301.  Thanks for any info, please 
email me directly if you have heard anything.

Cheers,
Dale 


